    "Electric load is simultaneously affected across multiple time scales by exogenous factors such as weather and calendar rhythms, sudden events, and policies.",
    "Textual information must be precisely matched to the correct time and location to be useful for forecasting.",
    "GRAFT strictly aligns daily-aggregated news, social media, and policy texts with half-hour load.",
    "GRAFT realizes text-guided fusion to specific time positions via cross-attention during both training and rolling forecasting.",
    "The framework proposes a grid-aware text-guided load forecasting framework based on STanHOP.",
    "The framework strictly aligns news, social media, and policy texts with half-hourly load data by date–region.",
    "Each piece of textual information is tagged with both temporal coordinate (the specific date it corresponds to) and spatial coordinate (the specific region it affects).",
    "GRAFT adopts STanHOP as its temporal backbone.",
    "GRAFT encodes news, social media, and policy texts into external memories aligned by date–region pairs.",
    "The encoding process transforms unstructured text into structured representations that can be precisely indexed and retrieved during forecasting.",
    "Previous approaches faced a critical limitation without making it difficult to locate the timing and intensity of textual influence and to provide verifiable attribution evidence.",
    "Position-aware mechanisms solve this by explicitly modeling when and where text impacts load.",
    "Through cross-attention and source gating, GRAFT enables text-guided load forecasting at the half-hour level.",
    "The position-dependent strategy performs multi-source fusion that respects the temporal structure of the data.",
    "GRAFT retains STanHOP's multi-resolution coarsening structure and pluggable memory modules.",
    "GRAFT explicitly models the time–region–source interactions.",
    "GRAFT significantly enhances responsiveness and interpretability in event-driven and extreme scenarios compared with the purely numerical STanHOP baseline.",
    "The framework conducts systematic, reproducible evaluations at three scales—hourly, daily, and monthly—under a unified protocol for comparison across regions, external sources, and time scales.",
    "At different scales, different sources provide varying value.",
    "GRAFT should employ gating and temporal-decay mechanisms so that News and Reddit can adaptively allocate their weights according to the scenario context in daily forecasting.",
    "LLM-based methods are constrained by the maximum token length of the underlying LLM.",
    "LLM constraints limit the ability to handle long-span or multi-region time series within a single prompt and often leads to truncation and loss of long-term information.",
    "GRAFT explicitly maps textual external sources into low-dimensional, structured features.",
    "GRAFT enables seamless integration with existing numerical forecasting pipelines.",
    "GRAFT facilitates straightforward extension to additional regions and longer temporal spans, without relying on ultra-long prompts or multi-round interactions.",
    "GRAFT performs offline encoding and date–region alignment.",
    "During online inference, GRAFT only requires a single forward pass through the numerical backbone.",
    "GRAFT significantly improves accuracy while keeping inference cost and engineering complexity under control.",
    "GRAFT provides a plug-and-play external-memory interface to accommodate different information sources in real-world deployment.",
    "The strict date-region alignment ensures that textual signals are attributed to the correct spatiotemporal context.",
    "Position-aware cross-attention enables the model to learn precisely when and how strongly each text source influences load patterns.",
    "This combination validates the strong numerical backbone + structured textual intervention paradigm.",
    "It preserves the stability and interpretability of numerical models, while fully exploiting the additional semantic information carried by news and social-media events."
] 

