    "Machine learning is profoundly reshaping molecular and materials modeling.",
    "Chemical space has a vast scale of 10³⁰–10⁶⁰.",
    "It remains an open scientific question whether models can achieve convergent learning across chemical space.",
    "The Dual-Axis RCCL strategy integrates two complementary encoding systems.",
    "GCN (Graph Convolutional Network) encodes local valence-bond environments.",
    "NBG (No-Bridge Graph) encodes ring/cage topologies.",
    "The combinatorial space of local atomic environments and ring/cage topologies are both relatively limited.",
    "The dual-axis representation combining GCN and NBG enables near-complete coverage of chemical space with finite data.",
    "The dual-axis representation supports interpretable and convergent dataset construction.",
    "A hierarchical graph-convolution representation (GCN0, GCN1, and GCN2) captures increasingly extended local neighborhoods (0–2 hop).",
    "GCN0 corresponds to an atom-centered valence descriptor defined by element type and first-shell coordination.",
    "GCN0 aligns with localized NBO-derived electronic environments while avoiding uncertainty arising from explicit bond-order assignments.",
    "First-shell valence environments form the minimal and sufficient units of local chemical diversity.",
    "This motivates the central role of GCN1-level representations.",
    "Perturbations arising from more distant molecular motifs lead to minimal changes in both individual and aggregate GCN0 energies.",
    "The GCN hierarchy forms the local structural axis of the RCCL framework.",
    "The GCN hierarchy complements global topological representations in downstream learning models.",
    "Ring/cage topologies induce systematic and reproducible shifts in energy that cannot be captured by local neighborhood encoding alone.",
    "In test datasets, tertiary carbon atoms in ring and chain environments show distinct average energy values (−2.639 vs −2.665 a.u.).",
    "The corresponding standard deviations are 0.062 and 0.055 a.u.",
    "These differences diminish once the first-shell structure is fixed.",
    "Their reproducibility highlights the necessity of introducing an independent topological axis.",
    "The No-Bridge Graph (NBG) representation explicitly encodes topological units whose properties cannot be inferred from local neighborhoods alone.",
    "These properties include valence-bond cooperativity, conjugation and spatial strain.",
    "NBG0 and NBG-Plus define the ring/cage topological axis of the RCCL framework.",
    "NBG0 and NBG-Plus are complementary to the local valence representations encoded by GCN.",
    "The FD25 dataset was constructed based on the Dual-Axis RCCL strategy.",
    "FD25 comprises 2.1 million M06-2X/cc-pVDZ–optimized organic molecules containing H, C, N, O, and F.",
    "FD25 provides near-complete coverage of organic chemical space through 13,302 local valence units (GCN axis).",
    "FD25 provides near-complete coverage of organic chemical space through 165,726 ring/cage topology units (NBG axis).",
    "This coverage substantially exceeds that of existing benchmark datasets.",
    "The Dual-Axis RCCL strategy enables data-efficient organic chemical-space coverage.",
    "With a nearly complete basis at GCN1 and NBG0, modest extensions to GCN2 and NBG-Plus capture essential chemical diversity.",
    "This substantially reduces dataset size and training cost.",
    "GDB-11 is a graph-theoretic enumerated dataset with 26.4 million molecules.",
    "FD25 contains only 2.23 million molecules.",
    "FD25 provides sufficient chemical-space coverage to support large-model training.",
    "When representation completeness is ensured, deep learning models can provide the required expressive capacity.",
    "GNNs encode distance-dependent interactions through multi-layer message passing.",
    "LLMs capture higher-order electronic correlations via deep attention mechanisms.",
    "Models trained on FD25 exhibit representation-complete convergent learning and strong cross-dataset generalization.",
    "Graph neural networks trained on FD25 exhibit representation-complete convergent learning and strong out-of-distribution generalization.",
    "The overall prediction error is approximately 1.0 kcal/mol MAE across external benchmarks.",
    "Results demonstrate a well-defined convergence threshold in organic chemical space under representation completeness.",
    "There is no benefit from additional higher-order structures.",
    "The Dual-Axis RCCL framework formalizes representation completeness.",
    "The framework establishes a principled basis for constructing datasets that support convergent learning for large models.",
    "The framework combines the GCN axis (capturing local electronic environments grounded in valence bond theory) with the NBG axis (capturing global ring/cage topologies).",
    "The framework achieves systematic, near-complete coverage of organic chemical space with finite, computationally tractable datasets."
] 

