    "SuperWing's geometry parameterization strategy offers several significant advantages over traditional baseline-perturbation approaches used in previous wing datasets.",
    "SuperWing enables better generalization capabilities for data-driven aerodynamic surrogate models.",
    "SuperWing employs a simplified yet expressive parameterization scheme.",
    "SuperWing creates wing geometries independently without relying on perturbations of a specific baseline wing.",
    "SuperWing incorporates spanwise variations in airfoil shape, twist, and dihedral to create enhanced diversity.",
    "SuperWing provides broader coverage of the design space through combinatorial variations of sectional geometries.",
    "The dataset includes 1,516 sets of CST (Class Shape Transformation) coefficients for baseline airfoils.",
    "Each wing geometry is defined by the CST coefficients of the baseline airfoil plus 18 additional parameters.",
    "The dataset employs cubic spline interpolation based on five spanwise control points to determine variations in dihedral angle, twist angle, maximum thickness, and maximum camber.",
    "Models pretrained on SuperWing demonstrate promising generalization capabilities when directly applied to complex benchmark wings such as DLR-F6 and NASA CRM.",
    "The trained models successfully capture key flow structures like shock waves and accurately predict aerodynamic coefficient trends, even on unseen wing geometries.",
    "Transformer-based models trained on SuperWing achieve an average CD (drag coefficient) prediction error of only 2.5 counts on the test set.",
    "Larger error regions still occur where sectional airfoils change significantly (e.g., the root-to-kink segment of DLR-F6).",
    "While SuperWing varies max thickness and camber spanwise, which helps learn the effect of sectional airfoil differences, further improvement might be possible with even more comprehensive parameterization.",
    "SuperWing enables data-driven models to learn underlying physical relationships that generalize across the wing shape design space.",
    "SuperWing results in surrogate models with significantly improved practical applicability for aerodynamic design optimization."
